<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN FIRST TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the end of</p>
<p>Pakistan's 1st innings on the fourth day of the first test match</p>
<p>against Sri Lanka in Colombo on Tuesday.</p>
<p>SRI LANKA 1st innings 330</p>
<p>PAKISTAN 370 for 9 overnight</p>
<p> Salim Elahi lbw b Vaas				  0</p>
<p> Rameez Raja c Ranatunga b Dharmasena	     50</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmed c Dharmasena b Muralitharan	  113</p>
<p> Salim Malik run out				    58</p>
<p> Inzamam-ul-Haq c sub (Kalpage) b Muralitharan  12</p>
<p> Asif Mujtaba c and b Muralitharan		  21</p>
<p> Moin Khan b Muralitharan				0</p>
<p> Saqlain Mushtaq run out				58</p>
<p> Mushtaq Ahmed b Muralitharan			 26</p>
<p> Shahid Nazir c Ranatunga b Muralitharan	   2</p>
<p> Mohammed Zahid not out				  6</p>
<p> Extras (b-11,lb-7,nb-14)			     32</p>
<p> Total (all out in 159.5 overs)		    378</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-0, 2-102, 3-219, 4-247, 5-248, 6-248,</p>
<p>7-298, 8-336, 9-349, 10-378</p>
<p>Bowling: Vaas 32-6-75-1; Zoysa 10-0-55-0 (7nb); Dharmasena</p>
<p>52.5-19-93-1; Muralitharan 53-19-98-6 (7nb); Jayasuriya</p>
<p>3-0-15-0; De Silva 4-0-16-0; Ranatunga 3-1-5-0; Arnold 2-1-3-0</p>
</text>
